      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GAIA'S GRAN (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Warrnambool behind Mystic Lulu (22.66) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Has the pace to be prominent. Expected to feature in the finish again. ATLAS LEGEND (4) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (25.80) there the start prior. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ILIUM (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into her races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when third (22.67) in a T3 RSTW at this track last time. Must be included in calculations. SMASH (1) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
